<p dir="auto">(<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="1142375682" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/WICG/webpackage/issues/713" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/WICG/webpackage/issues/713/hovercard" href="https://github.com/WICG/webpackage/issues/713">WICG/webpackage#713</a>)<br>
(<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2796270897" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/37701" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/37701/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/37701">#37701</a>)</p>
]]></content>
